m/getlantern/radiance/commit/cbec45e3fc23c715acc32158b28c10154ef8abe4","commit_subject":"kindling/soar: key the resolver cache by the country discovery used","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"ProteoWizard/pwiz","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-10T21:44:25Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"5a1cd82efcde32964c26a30e4817e9ace84ed822","github_link":"https://github.com/ProteoWizard/pwiz/commit/5a1cd82efcde32964c26a30e4817e9ace84ed822","commit_subject":"osprey: Moved the transfer pass-2 per-file half into PerFileRescoring (#4816)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"TeamHypersomnia/Hypersomnia","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-10T21:44:00Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"66e512f6e05b6c6d7c2f3ccce687682b69d8f38d","github_link":"https://github.com/TeamHypersomnia/Hypersomnia/commit/66e512f6e05b6c6d7c2f3ccce687682b69d8f38d","commit_subject":"Secure connections to the official servers: before joining a ranked server, an official casual one with secure_connection_to_official_casual_servers, or one not yet on the server list, the client fetches a connect token from connect_token_provider (https://hypersomnia.io/connect_token) and connects with it, so the session keys are known only to it and that server; an official server starts netcode with the key derived from its official_server_secret and also takes insecure tokens, telling the connections apart by the server id in the token's user data; authentication only ever goes over a secure connection - clients send no tickets over insecure ones and servers ignore them, ranked servers kick insecure clients with the reason, a missing token where it is required stops the client before connecting - and the Steam ticket identity is the challenge plus the id of the official server the token was issued for, so a ticket given to one official server can not be passed on to another","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"TeamHypersomnia/Hypersomnia","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-10T21:44:00Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"687a89d7959ca071b0c3544f8eb8d5a4ec2b01c5","github_link":"https://github.com/TeamHypersomnia/Hypersomnia/commit/687a89d7959ca071b0c3544f8eb8d5a4ec2b01c5","commit_subject":"Masterserver: /connect_token?server=<ip:port or WebRTC id> issues a secure connect token for an official server - encrypted with that server's netcode key (derived from its official_server_secret), valid for 60 s, with \"HSEC1\" and the server id in the user data - and returns it with the client id and the server id as JSON; 404 for anything not currently listed as official, at most 30 requests a minute per IP (X-Real-IP when proxied from localhost); the targets are rebuilt on the main thread whenever the list, an official status or official_servers.d changes","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"sumatrapdfreader/sumatrapdf","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-10T21:43:57Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"ba5ff1df0e6bcbc37937c308a84c796363e8c25d","github_link":"https://github.com/sumatrapdfreader/sumatrapdf/commit/ba5ff1df0e6bcbc37937c308a84c796363e8c25d","commit_subject":"Share overlay scrollbar geometry and show / hide","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"jonasblixt/ufsm","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-10T21:43:56Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"ae723e8cde4dd48fd8ad5a3a145d9255b22999e4","github_link":"https://github.com/jonasblixt/ufsm/commit/ae723e8cde4dd48fd8ad5a3a145d9255b22999e4","commit_subject":"test: Accept the hand-tidied test_model1.ufsm","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"TeamHypersomnia/Hypersomnia","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-10T21:43:50Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"24fdef3ea1dc86b54300b2fc2a540b3d8b013d2c","github_link":"https://github.com/TeamHypersomnia/Hypersomnia/commit/24fdef3ea1dc86b54300b2fc2a540b3d8b013d2c","commit_subject":"yojimbo: netcode accept_insecure_connect_tokens, so an official server can take both the secure connect tokens from the masterserver and the insecure ones clients make themselves","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"LoveDaisy/Lumice","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-10T21:43:45Z","branch":"main","commit_sha